<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54910" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπρην-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>down-turned</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπτιος</span>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always of the hand as used in striking or grasping, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆξεν . . Χειρὶ καταπρηνεῖ</span>
			<i>with the flat of</i> his hand, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.792
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.164
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπλήγετο μηρὼ Χερσὶ καταπρηνέσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.114
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χείρεσσι κ. λαβοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.467
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ κ. ῥέποντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			. (
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπρανής</span>, q.
		v.)</div>
